From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port the thumbnails from QtGraphicalEffects to QtQuick.Effects

The app imports QtGraphicalEffects, which Qt 6 does not ship (it is
Qt5Compat.GraphicalEffects there), so appMain.qml fails to load and the app
exits as soon as it is launched.

Moving the import to Qt5Compat.GraphicalEffects is not enough on Halium
hammerhead (Adreno 330 behind libhybris): Qt5Compat's OpacityMask and
ColorOverlay draw nothing there, so every rounded thumbnail would come out
empty. QtQuick.Effects' MultiEffect renders correctly on the same device, so
use it.

RoundSquareThumbnail.qml: the rounded-corner OpacityMask becomes a MultiEffect
mask. MultiEffect samples its mask as a texture and ignores one that is not a
layer, so the mask is a layer-enabled Rectangle of its own, and it is no longer
anchored to main_image.Center, which is not a valid anchor line. The
ColorOverlay on the empty-image placeholder becomes a MultiEffect with
colorization set to 1.0.

HorizentalListComponent.qml only had the import and used nothing from it.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/com.webos.app.mediagallery/qml/App/View/MainScreen/ListComponent/HorizentalListComponent.qml
+++ b/com.webos.app.mediagallery/qml/App/View/MainScreen/ListComponent/HorizentalListComponent.qml
@@ -18,7 +18,6 @@
 
 import QtQuick 2.12
 import QmlAppComponents 0.1
-import QtGraphicalEffects 1.0
 
 FocusScope {
     id: root
--- a/com.webos.app.mediagallery/qml/App/View/MainScreen/ListComponent/RoundSquareThumbnail.qml
+++ b/com.webos.app.mediagallery/qml/App/View/MainScreen/ListComponent/RoundSquareThumbnail.qml
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@
 * LICENSE@@@ */
 
 import QtQuick 2.6
-import QtGraphicalEffects 1.0
+import QtQuick.Effects
 
 Item {
     id: root
@@ -25,6 +25,15 @@
     height: 200 // default
     readonly property string emptyImageUrl: appRoot.imageDir + "empty_image.png"
     property string src: emptyImageUrl
+    // MultiEffect samples its mask as a texture, so the mask is a layer
+    Rectangle {
+        id: thumbnailMask
+        width: root.width
+        height: root.height
+        radius: Math.min(width,height) * 0.2
+        layer.enabled: true
+        visible: false
+    }
     Image{
         id: main_image
         anchors.verticalCenter: root.verticalCenter
@@ -35,13 +44,9 @@
         sourceSize.width: width
         asynchronous: true
         layer.enabled: true
-        layer.effect: OpacityMask {
-            maskSource: Rectangle{
-                anchors.centerIn: main_image.Center
-                width: main_image.width
-                height: main_image.height
-                radius: Math.min(width,height) * 0.2
-            }
+        layer.effect: MultiEffect {
+            maskEnabled: true
+            maskSource: thumbnailMask
         }
         property var emptyImageScale: 0.8
         Image {
@@ -55,10 +60,11 @@
             source: emptyImageUrl
             fillMode: Image.PreserveAspectFit
 
-            ColorOverlay {
+            MultiEffect {
                 anchors.fill: empty_image
                 source: empty_image
-                color: appStyle.appColor.emptyImageColor
+                colorization: 1.0
+                colorizationColor: appStyle.appColor.emptyImageColor
             }
         }
 
